      "content": "i get what you're saying... i really do. but it's hard to see it that way when all i see is how much they're sacrificing to keep me going. it feels selfish, honestly. just being alive and needing so much stuff from them constantly. like, wouldn't they be more free if they didn't have to worry about me all the time?",
